{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And let it go out.</b> The reason for ויצעק (\"and he cried out\") is that he trusted in the Name that He would not put him to shame, for he said to Pharaoh on his own authority, 'As you say,' without permission from HaShem."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:34.490795711Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}